  "body": " Run the following code. Click on the \"Show Code Lens\" button and then the Next button to step through the code.  public class AsgnEx { public static void main(String[] args) { int num1, num2; \/\/ Declare the variables in memory num1 = 50; \/\/ (a) Assign 50 to num1 num2 = 10 + 15; \/\/ (b) Assign 25 to num2 num1 = num2; \/\/ (c) Copy num2's value (25) into num1 System.out.println(\"num1 is \" + num1 + \" and num2 is \" + num2); } } "
