  "body": " Tax Whiz Challenge   Challenge: Define a class named TaxWhiz that computes the sales tax for a purchase. It should store the current tax rate as an instance variable. Following the model of the Riddle class, you can initialize the rate using a TaxWhiz() constructor. This class should have one public method, calcTax(double purchase) , which will return a double , whose value is purchases times the tax rate. For example, if the tax rate is 4 percent, 0.04, and the purchase is $100, then calcTax() should return 4.0.   "
