  "title": "Formal Parameter.",
  "body": " Formal Parameter  A formal parameter or more simply, parameter , formal parameter is a variable that serves as a storage location for information that is passed to a method. To specify a formal parameter, you must provide a type identifier followed by variable identifier, and you must place this declaration inside the parentheses that follow the method's name.  "
