  "number": "5.5.13",
  "title": "Pre- and Postincrement\/Decrement.",
  "body": " Pre- and Postincrement\/Decrement  If an expression like ++k or k occurs in an expression, k is incremented or decremented before its value is used in the rest of the expression. If an expression like k++ or k occurs in an expression, k is incremented or decremented after its value is used in the rest of the expression.  "
