  "body": " Try the following demo of these math operations to round a decimal value. Try changing the value of r and try again.   public class RoundingDemo { public static void main(String[] args) { double r = 75.19999; System.out.println(\"r: \" + r); double rFloored = Math.floor(r * 100.0 + 0.5) \/ 100.0; System.out.println(\"Math.floor \" + rFloored); double rRounded = Math.round(100.0 * r) \/ 100.0; System.out.println(\"Math.round: \" + rRounded); } }   "
