  "type": "Exercise",
  "number": "5.13.15",
  "title": "Evaluate Expressions.",
  "body": " Evaluate Expressions   Parenthesize and evaluate each of the following expressions. (If an expression is invalid, mark it as such):     11 \/ 3 % 2 == 1      11 \/ 2 % 2 > 0      15 % 3 >= 21 %      12.0 \/ 4.0 >= 12 \/ 3      15 \/ 3 == true    "
