  "title": "",
  "body": " Run the code below. Try changing the bounds of the loops to change the pattern.   public class Pattern { public static void main(String[] args) { for (int row = 1; row <= 5; row++) { \/\/ For each row for (int j = 1; j <= 6 - row; j++)\/\/ Print the row System.out.print('#'); System.out.println(); \/\/ Start a new line } \/\/ for row } }  "
