  "title": "Nested Loop Pattern.",
  "body": "Nested Loop Pattern  Write nested for loops to print a right triangle with a base of 5 # symbols.   public class Pattern { public static void main(String[] args) { \/\/ Write nested for loops to print a right triangle with a base of 5 # symbols. } }   Write a nested for loop to print the following geometric pattern: # # # # # # # # # # # # # # # for (int row = 1; row <= 5; row++) { \/\/ For each row for (int col = 1; col <= row; col++) \/\/ Columns per row System.out.print('#'); System.out.println(); \/\/ New line } \/\/ row    "
