  "body": " Pre\/Post Conditions 2   Identify the pre- and postconditions for the following method, which computes for : public double power(double x, int n) { double pow = 1; for (int k = 1; k <= n; k++) pow = pow * x; return pow; } \/\/ power()      Identify the pre- and postconditions for the following method, which computes for . \/\/ Precondition: N >= 0 \/\/ Postcondition: power(x,n) == x to the n public double power(double x, int n ) { double pow = 1; for (int k = 1; k <= n; k++) pow = pow * x; return pow; } \/\/ power()    "
