  "body": " Keyword search  Suppose S is our string and K is the keyword. Initialize a counter variable and result string. Set Ptr to the indexOf() the first occurrence of K in S. While (Ptr != -1) Increment the counter Insert Ptr into the result string Set Ptr to the next location of the keyword in S Insert the count into the result string Return the result string as a String  "
