  "body": " Substring expressions 2   Given this String declaration  String s = \"abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\";  evaluate each of the following expressions.  (Note: All your answers should be enclosed within \"\" marks.)    s.substring(20, s.length())     s.substring(s.indexOf('b'), s.indexOf('f'))     s.substring(s.indexOf(\"xy\"))     s.substring(s.indexOf(s.charAt(23)))     s.substring(s.length() - 3)          Correct.      Incorrect. This is equivalent to s.substring(20) .        Correct.      Incorrect. This is equivalent to s.substring(1, 5) .        Correct. The substring from 'x' to the end of the string.      Incorrect. This is equivalent to s.substring(23) .        Correct.      Incorrect. This is equivalent to the preceding expression.        Correct. Good job!      Incorrect. This is equivalent to the preceding expression.       (a) uvwxyz , (b) bcde , (c) xyz , (d) xyz , (e) xyz    "
