  "body": " Defining and using the Speakable interface.  public interface Speakable { public String speak(); } public class Animal { protected String kind; \/\/ Cow, pig, cat, etc. public Animal() { } public String toString() { return \"I am a \" + kind + \" and I go \" + ((Speakable)this).speak(); } }  "
