  "body": "  The only new classes we needed to create a new two-player game were the WordGuess ( Listing ) and WordGuesser ( Listing ) classes. The gamr inherited the rest of its functionality from the TwoPlayerGame hierarchy.  Use the replit below to experiment with the game. You can inspect the source code in the replit.    "
