  "body": " Selection sort   Arrange the following blocks to complete the implemention of selection sort. public void selectionSort(int arr[]) { int smallest = 0; for (int k = 0; k < arr.length -1; k++) { \/\/ Implement here } \/\/ outer } \/\/ selectionSort()      smallest = k;    for (int i k+1; i<arr.length; i++) {    if (arr[i] < arr[smallest])    smallest = j;    }    swap(arr, k, smallest);      smallest = k; for (int i k+1; i<arr.length; i++) { if (arr[i] < arr[smallest]) smallest = j; } swap(arr, k, smallest);   "
