  "title": "An example of dynamic versus static scoping.",
  "body": " An example of dynamic versus static scoping.  public class MyClass { public void method1() { int X = 1; System.out.println(\"Hello\" + X); } public void method2() { int Y = 2; System.out.println(\"Hello\" + Y); } public static void main( String argv[] ) { MyClass myclass = new MyClass(); if (Math.random() > 0.5) myclass.method2(); else myclass.method1(); } } \/\/ MyClass  "
