  "url": "recursive-string-methods.html#sum1-n",
  "type": "Exercise",
  "number": "12.3.3.1",
  "title": "Sum of 1 to N.",
  "body": " Sum of 1 to N   Here's a numerical problem. Write a recursive method to compute the sum of 1 to N , given N as a parameter. That is, , for .   public class Main { \/\/ Your static sum1toN() method definition goes here public static void main(String args[]) { System.out.println(\"The sum of 1 to 10 = \" + sum1toN(10)); } }   int sum1toN(int N) { if (N == 0) return 0; else return N + sum1toN(N-1); }   "
